\description{
\code{ridge_path()} refits the same model across a grid of loading-ridge
penalty scales (\code{tau}, i.e. \code{gllvmTMBcontrol(loading_ridge = tau)}) and
reports, for every trait, how the largest loading and its communality
move as the penalty weakens (\code{tau} growing toward \code{Inf}, i.e. plain
